{"id":"bc4ad8dba28adfd5","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-iter.md","title":"一阶关系迭代资源类 ITER","display":"df-iter — 一阶关系迭代资源类 ITER","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-iter","aliases":["29-df-iter"],"display":"df-iter — 一阶关系迭代资源类 ITER","depends_on":["[[29-df-simultaneous-iteration]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-bool-query]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 10.9, p.160, DjVu scan 175","source_basis":"原书文本层与扫描图175；次数约定和输入类限制在正文显式给出"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-iter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-iter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-iter — 一阶关系迭代资源类 ITER"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f12f36e10770cfc\" href=\"?note=2f12f36e10770cfc\" title=\"29-df-simultaneous-iteration\">29-df-simultaneous-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"92256ad8556a5baf\" href=\"?note=92256ad8556a5baf\" title=\"29-df-bool-query\">29-df-bool-query</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 10.9, p.160, DjVu scan 175"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书文本层与扫描图175；次数约定和输入类限制在正文显式给出"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sys}_{m,k}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathsf{Sys}_{m,k}[\\tau]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"o_{A,\\mathcal I}(r)\">\\(o_{A,\\mathcal I}(r)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2f12f36e10770cfc\" href=\"?note=2f12f36e10770cfc\" title=\"29-df-simultaneous-iteration\">29-df-simultaneous-iteration</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_A=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\">\\(n_A=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> 是显式指定的输入类；没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 参数的记号取全体有限非空输入结构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"92256ad8556a5baf\" href=\"?note=92256ad8556a5baf\" title=\"29-df-bool-query\">29-df-bool-query</a>；每个系统、初态、读出公式和常数系数都对整个查询固定，迭代次数取精确的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\,t(n_A)\">\\(d\\,t(n_A)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ITER}\">\\(\\mathrm{ITER}\\)</span> 是以下定义的查询类记号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\mathcal I,t,d}\">\\(Q_{\\mathcal I,t,d}\\)</span> 是以下构造的查询。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_{\\mathcal I,t,d}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid o_{A,\\mathcal I}(d\\,t(n_A))=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_{\\mathcal I,t,d}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid o_{A,\\mathcal I}(d\\,t(n_A))=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ITER}[t,k,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{Q_{\\mathcal I,t,d}\\mid m,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},\\ \\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Sys}_{m,k}[\\tau]\\}\\cap\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ITER}[t,k,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{Q_{\\mathcal I,t,d}\\mid m,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},\\ \\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Sys}_{m,k}[\\tau]\\}\\cap\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ITER}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{ITER}[t,k,\\tau],\\qquad\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c\\geq1}\\mathrm{ITER}[n\\mapsto2^{c n^k},k,\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ITER}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{ITER}[t,k,\\tau],\\qquad\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c\\geq1}\\mathrm{ITER}[n\\mapsto2^{c n^k},k,\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ITER}[t,k,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{Q\\cap\\mathcal D\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{ITER}[t,k,\\tau]\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{ITER}[t,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{Q\\cap\\mathcal D\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{ITER}[t,\\tau]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ITER}[t,k,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{Q\\cap\\mathcal D\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{ITER}[t,k,\\tau]\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{ITER}[t,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{Q\\cap\\mathcal D\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{ITER}[t,\\tau]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{Q\\cap\\mathcal D\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{Q\\cap\\mathcal D\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 10.9，印刷页160、扫描页175；指数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{c n^k}\">\\(2^{c n^k}\\)</span> 已查看原图。这里沿用本目录资源界吸收固定常数的约定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 控制每个可变关系的元数，关系数量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 为查询相关常数。该类读取指定轮数的关系状态，不把非单调迭代误解为每轮只增加元组，也不以“最终是否稳定”代替指定轮数的读出。可选输入类参数是本地显式限制接口。任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的记号本身不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 可计算；调用与机器时间有关的定理时仍须保留该定理的可构造性前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-simultaneous-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"2f12f36e10770cfc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-simultaneous-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bool-query","status":"resolved","id":"92256ad8556a5baf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bool-query]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-simultaneous-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"2f12f36e10770cfc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Sys}_{m,k}[\\tau]$、$o_{A,\\mathcal I}(r)$ 见 [[29-df-simultaneous-iteration]]；$n_A=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bool-query","status":"resolved","id":"92256ad8556a5baf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-bool-query]]；每个系统、初态、读出公式和常数系数都对整个查询固定，迭代次数取精确的 $d\\,t(n_A)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"t:\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\to\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sys}_{m,k}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"o_{A,\\mathcal I}(r)","display":false},{"tex":"n_A=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"d\\,t(n_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ITER}","display":false},{"tex":"Q_{\\mathcal I,t,d}","display":false},{"tex":"Q_{\\mathcal I,t,d}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid o_{A,\\mathcal I}(d\\,t(n_A))=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ITER}[t,k,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\{Q_{\\mathcal I,t,d}\\mid m,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},\\ \\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Sys}_{m,k}[\\tau]\\}\\cap\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ITER}[t,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\geq1}\\mathrm{ITER}[t,k,\\tau],\\qquad\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{c\\geq1}\\mathrm{ITER}[n\\mapsto2^{c n^k},k,\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ITER}[t,k,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{Q\\cap\\mathcal D\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{ITER}[t,k,\\tau]\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{ITER}[t,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{Q\\cap\\mathcal D\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{ITER}[t,\\tau]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau;\\mathcal D]\\coloneqq\\{Q\\cap\\mathcal D\\mid Q\\in\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"2^{c n^k}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false}],"bytes":2588,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-114","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-simultaneous-iteration]]、[[29-df-iter]]、[[29-df-fo-iteration]] — 同时关系迭代、ITER 与 FO[t]"},{"id":"4350a4d66b0db7a7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-iter]]；确定性空间类使用 [[29-df-complexity-classes]] 的只读输入、工作空间及停机约定。"},{"id":"73e3feb902982212","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VAR}[k+1,\\tau]$ 见 [[29-df-var]]；$\\mathrm{ITER}[\\operatorname{arity}k,\\tau^\\uparrow]$ 见 [[29-df-iter]]。$\\mathrm{BoolQuery}[\\tau^\\uparrow]$ 见 [[29-df-bool-query]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-iter]]"}],"outgoing":["2f12f36e10770cfc","4de8e0c8085801f5","92256ad8556a5baf"]}